em":234,"icon":235},"CRI Format","\u002Fplatform\u002Freference\u002Fcri-format","04.platform\u002F12.reference\u002F01.cri-format","i-lucide-link",{"title":237,"path":238,"stem":239,"icon":240},"Grind Jobs","\u002Fplatform\u002Freference\u002Fgrind-jobs","04.platform\u002F12.reference\u002F02.grind-jobs","i-lucide-workflow",{"title":242,"path":243,"stem":244,"icon":179},"Project Publishing Design","\u002Fplatform\u002Freference\u002Fproject-publishing-design","04.platform\u002F12.reference\u002F03.project-publishing-design",{"title":246,"path":247,"stem":248,"icon":38},"Sign-In Design","\u002Fplatform\u002Freference\u002Fsign-in-design","04.platform\u002F12.reference\u002F04.sign-in-design",{"title":250,"path":251,"stem":252,"icon":253},"Development Server","\u002Fplatform\u002Fdevelopment-server","04.platform\u002F13.development-server","i-lucide-server-cog",{"title":255,"path":256,"stem":257,"icon":258},"Supply Chain Security","\u002Fplatform\u002Fsupply-chain-security","04.platform\u002F14.supply-chain-security","i-lucide-package-check",{"title":260,"path":261,"stem":262,"icon":263},"Enterprise License","\u002Fplatform\u002Fenterprise-license","04.platform\u002F15.enterprise-license","i-lucide-badge-check",{"id":265,"title":11,"body":266,"description":472,"extension":473,"links":474,"meta":475,"navigation":476,"path":12,"seo":477,"stem":13,"__hash__":478},"docs\u002F01.getting-started\u002F01.introduction.md",{"type":267,"value":268,"toc":464},"minimark",[269,273,278,281,285,313,317,398,404,410,416,420,423,457],[270,271,272],"p",{},"Kinotic is a next-generation cloud operating system that abstracts away infrastructure complexity so developers and AI agents can focus on what matters: building great applications.",[274,275,277],"h2",{"id":276},"humane-representation-of-thought","Humane Representation of Thought",[270,279,280],{},"The rise of AI-assisted development has unlocked a new paradigm -- rapid iteration driven by natural-language intent and intelligent code generation. Kinotic is purpose-built for this paradigm. Whether a human developer or an AI agent is writing the code, Kinotic provides the guardrails, services, and runtime that turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[274,282,284],{"id":283},"core-components","Core Components",[286,287,288,296,301,307],"ul",{},[289,290,291,295],"li",{},[292,293,294],"strong",{},"Kinotic Apps"," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[289,297,298,300],{},[292,299,171],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[289,302,303,306],{},[292,304,305],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[289,308,309,312],{},[292,310,311],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[274,314,316],{"id":315},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[318,319,320,336],"table",{},[321,322,323],"thead",{},[324,325,326,330,333],"tr",{},[327,328,329],"th",{},"Concern",[327,331,332],{},"Without Kinotic",[327,334,335],{},"With Kinotic",[337,338,339,351,366,377,388],"tbody",{},[324,340,341,345,348],{},[342,343,344],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[342,346,347],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[342,349,350],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[324,352,353,355,358],{},[342,354,89],{},[342,356,357],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[342,359,360,361,365],{},"Define entities, run ",[362,363,364],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[324,367,368,371,374],{},[342,369,370],{},"Service Mesh",[342,372,373],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[342,375,376],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[324,378,379,382,385],{},[342,380,381],{},"CI\u002FCD",[342,383,384],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[342,386,387],{},"Handled by the platform",[324,389,390,392,395],{},[342,391,208],{},[342,393,394],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[342,396,397],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[270,399,400,403],{},[292,401,402],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[270,405,406,409],{},[292,407,408],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[270,411,412,415],{},[292,413,414],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[274,417,419],{"id":418},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[270,421,422],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[424,425,426,431,437,442,447,452],"ol",{},[289,427,428,430],{},[292,429,15],{}," -- Scaffold a project and persist your first entity in under five minutes.",[289,432,433,436],{},[292,434,435],{},"Application Structure"," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[289,438,439,441],{},[292,440,68],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[289,443,444,446],{},[292,445,89],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[289,448,449,451],{},[292,450,122],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[289,453,454,456],{},[292,455,131],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[270,458,459,460,463],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[461,462,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":465,"searchDepth":466,"depth":466,"links":467},"",2,[468,469,470,471],{"id":276,"depth":466,"text":277},{"id":283,"depth":466,"text":284},{"id":315,"depth":466,"text":316},{"id":418,"depth":466,"text":419},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":472},"wdYFnl3txNFacN67GOogPYohC-2wXWx0HZS6Y8W5ZlU",[474,480],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":481,"children":-1},"Get started building your first Kinotic App -- from a provisioned project to a running CRUD service in under five minutes.",1793011039290]